ulgences. Each archetype brings distinct abilities and synergies that reward timing, strategy, and a healthy appetite for risk. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So drink deep… but don’t get attached. Every transformation is a step toward insanity’s sweet embrace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/0d66af2e094fa7b37752310f7d6c1ae9.poster.avif?t=1784114455\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/0d66af2e094fa7b37752310f7d6c1ae9.webm?t=1784114455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/0d66af2e094fa7b37752310f7d6c1ae9.mp4?t=1784114455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Multiplayer Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No one gives you orders, do they, darling? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twelve Grimrunners enter every match, each driven by their own ambitions. Cooperation is optional. Sometimes efficient, more often delightfully ill-advised. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city provides opportunities, not obligations. Hunt the Gloomfiend or complete other quests. Scavenge, stalk, or grind for power. Sabotage others and take what they earned. Indulge yourself. We encourage it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression persists between runs, unlocking new rewards, upgrades, and strategies. Mastery is rewarded. Complacency is… addressed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/3be82e8991569334e5ebee36c0c4185b.poster.avif?t=1784114455\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/3be82e8991569334e5ebee36c0c4185b.webm?t=1784114455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/3be82e8991569334e5ebee36c0c4185b.mp4?t=1784114455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Optional High-Stakes Boss Hunts</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Madness begins at the end. </i><br><i></i><br>As the run nears its end, the city offers one last temptation. Summon a unique Gloomfiend, larger and more grotesque than anything you’ve faced so far. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Terror Seeds </strong>they drop are glorious. Some would say worth the risk. But nothing is mandatory here. A bloodsoaked battle with an eldritch monstrosity is <i>completely </i>optional. If you can resist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/0c654219437854d050e852043ea363ae.poster.avif?t=1784114455\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/0c654219437854d050e852043ea363ae.webm?t=1784114455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/0c654219437854d050e852043ea363ae.mp4?t=1784114455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A City That Watches Back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You were noticed the moment you arrived. </i><br><i></i><br>Explore a decaying urban sprawl dense with verticality, interiors, and forgotten paths. Slip through alleys. Track movement through walls. The city reacts to your presence, and it lives to see you squirm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horrors lurk around every corner. One second, you’re the hunter. The next, you’re prey. Pick the wrong fight at the wrong time, and you will be corrected. Thoroughly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandon hope of conquering this place. The best you can do is appease it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/922dd0249eb49a98fa545c237f25c902.poster.avif?t=1784114455\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/922dd0249eb49a98fa545c237f25c902.webm?t=1784114455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/922dd0249eb49a98fa545c237f25c902.mp4?t=1784114455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Horrifying New World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Familiar shapes, distorted proportions. </i><br><i></i><br>Inspired by cosmic horror and dark folklore, <strong>Nightholme </strong>twists your precious tropes until they beg for mercy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is lush and endlessly replayable. Leaving becomes a merely theoretical exercise. Stylized visuals lure you in, but secrets are what close the door behind you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you descend, the stranger it gets. You <i>do </i>have an escape plan… don’t you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/52f5909826ad03034565290910efcd34.poster.avif?t=1784114455\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/52f5909826ad03034565290910efcd34.webm?t=1784114455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/52f5909826ad03034565290910efcd34.mp4?t=1784114455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>So… Ready to Begin?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Marvelous. </i><br><i></i><br>Twelve Grimrunners enter a city. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some leave with what they came for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one leaves the same. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome home. <i>We’ve been so eager to meet you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/0bb744f12801d664cbcd96760823f099.poster.avif?t=1784114455\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/0bb744f12801d664cbcd96760823f099.webm?t=1784114455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/0bb744f12801d664cbcd96760823f099.mp4?t=1784114455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/337491cceec511a7512d4ab2bf4dd45d.webp?t=1784114455\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Team up or strike out alone to hunt an eldritch Gloomfiend in a city crawling with horrors. Channel corruption and transform into a monstrous Grimspawn for devastating bursts of power. But beware. Madness is patient, and you look delicious. Survive the run. Take the prize. No one leaves unchanged.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>